.TH WLIST-IMPORT 1 "17 November 2026" "version 0.2.0"
.SH NAME
wlist-import \- import items into registry.
.SH SYNOPSIS
wlist import [path/to/database]
[--input-file <file path> | -i <file path>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import items to registry
.PP
Supported formats include:
.RS
.IP
JSON
.IP
TSV
.IP
ODS
.IP
Excel
.RE
.PP
Imports are done based on file extension.
.PP
However, only JSON, Excel, and ODS support notes.
.SH OPTIONS
.B -i <file path>, --input-file <file path>
The file to load from.
.PP
This determines how the files are parsed.
.SH AUTHOR
Bryce Campbell (tonyhawk2100@gmail.com)
.SH EXAMPLES
import from TSV:
.RS
wlist import -i items.tsv
.RE